    "peri_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "know-your-peri-peri",
        "liquid": "\n<style>\n  .sea-pepper {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 300px);\n    gap: 34px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__rows {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n    gap: 10px 16px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__name {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__tag {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: var(--gold);\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__meter {\n    grid-column: 2;\n    grid-row: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 4px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip {\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d8cfc0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip.is-on {\n    background: #b8462f;\n    border-color: #b8462f;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__note {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__legend {\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__cap {\n    margin: 10px 0 0;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 989px) {\n    .sea-pepper {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__figure {\n      order: -1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-pepper\">\n  <div class=\"sea-pepper__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"sea-pepper__body\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__eyebrow\">Know what you are reaching for</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sea-pepper__heading\">Peri-peri is a chili, a sauce and a dry blend &mdash; and they are not interchangeable.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__lede\">\n        Peri-peri (piri-piri, pil-pil) is the African bird&rsquo;s eye chili, and the\n        Portuguese-Mozambican marinade built around it: chili, garlic, lemon, vinegar, paprika,\n        a little oil. The jar on the shelf and the shaker next to it behave completely\n        differently on fish. The blend seasons and chars. The sauce is already acidic and wet,\n        so it wants less time and a hotter, drier pan. This recipe is written for the blend.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__rows\">\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Peri-peri seasoning blend</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">As written</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Heat: 3 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Dry, so it clings to an oiled fillet and chars rather than steams. Ten minutes is all the time it needs.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Peri-peri sauce, from the bottle</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Heat: 3 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Wetter and sharper. Use about half as much, pat the fillet before it goes on the heat, and keep the rest for the table.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Harissa</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Heat: 2 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Rose harissa is the closest easy swap &mdash; same smoke and garlic, more caraway, less citrus. Add a squeeze of lemon to the oil.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Cayenne, smoked paprika, garlic powder</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Heat: 3 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">The pantry build. Two parts smoked paprika to one part cayenne, a big pinch of garlic powder, lemon zest, salt.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>Gochugaru or Aleppo</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Heat: 1 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">If you are cooking for someone heat-averse. Far milder, still red, still smoky &mdash; you lose the vinegar edge, so finish with extra lemon.</p>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__legend\">\n        Heat is shown relative to each other, not on any official scale. Bird&rsquo;s eye chilies\n        vary enormously by batch, so taste your blend on a fingertip before you commit a fillet\n        to it.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"sea-pepper__figure\">\n      <img\n        src=\"{{ 'peri-peri-salmon-seasoning-blend.jpg' | file_url }}\"\n        alt=\"Peri-peri seasoning blend being poured over Seatopia salmon portions in a mixing bowl\"\n        width=\"1200\"\n        height=\"1600\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\">\n      <figcaption class=\"sea-pepper__cap\">\n        The blend goes on after the oil, not before &mdash; oil first is what makes it stick\n        instead of sliding into the bottom of the bowl.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 16,
        "divider": false,
        "narrow": false,
        "rounded": false,
        "color_text": "",
        "color_background": "",
