        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>Seven steps, and four of them are waiting. The recipe card above has the short version to cook from &mdash; this is the same thing with the reasoning attached.</p>",
        "heading": "The game plan",
        "color_text": "",
