    "sheet_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "grill-on-a-sheet",
        "liquid": "\n<style>\n  .sea-sheet {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    max-width: 22ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n    max-width: 68ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__cols {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__num {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col h3 {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 7px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__foot {\n    margin: 18px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-sheet {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-sheet__cols {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"sea-sheet\">\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__eyebrow\">The step people skip</p>\n  <h2 class=\"sea-sheet__heading\">Preheat the sheet pan with the grill.</h2>\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__lede\">\n    Getaway Plate grills these on a baking sheet set on the grate rather than on the bars\n    themselves, and it is the difference between a crust and a mess. Peri-peri is oil plus\n    ground spice: dripped straight onto coals it flares, and the sugars in the paprika scorch\n    black before the centre of the fillet is warm. A preheated sheet gives you the grill&rsquo;s\n    heat and smoke with a surface the spice can actually brown against.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-sheet__cols\">\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col sea-sheet__col--pick\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">1</span>\n      <h3>The sheet goes on empty</h3>\n      <p>Put it on the grate while the grill comes up to medium-high and leave it there for a\n      good five minutes. A cold pan is why fish sticks &mdash; the protein grabs the metal\n      before a crust can form.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">2</span>\n      <h3>Lay the fish away from you</h3>\n      <p>Three to four minutes, lid down, and do not move it. It releases when the crust is\n      set; if it resists the spatula it is not ready, and forcing it takes the crust off with\n      the pan.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">3</span>\n      <h3>Flip once, then pull early</h3>\n      <p>Another three to four minutes on the second side. Pull it while the centre is still\n      slightly translucent &mdash; it carries on cooking on the platter, and the grill has more\n      residual heat than a stovetop pan.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__foot\">\n    No grill? A cast-iron pan over medium-high does the same job indoors, and a sheet pan under\n    a broiler set high, about six inches from the element, gets you close on the char. Open a\n    window either way &mdash; chili and smoke is the point of the dish and it will find you.\n  </p>\n</div>\n",
        "padding_top": 24,
        "padding_bottom": 24,
        "divider": false,
        "narrow": false,
        "rounded": false,
        "color_text": "",
        "color_background": "",
        "gradient_background": ""
      }
    },
