    "meal_prep": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "m_sub": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Make it ahead",
            "subheading_size": "subtitle-md",
            "secondary_color": true
          }
        },
        "m_head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Mix the blend ahead, not the marinade",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "m_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The spice is the part that keeps. Mix a jar of it &mdash; smoked paprika, cayenne, garlic, oregano, lemon zest, salt &mdash; and it sits happily in the cupboard for months, which turns this into a fifteen-minute dinner on any night you have salmon thawed.</p><p>What does not keep is the fish in the marinade. Ten minutes is the window; an hour later the acid has firmed the surface and you will grill something closer to gravlax than to a steak. Cooked, it is good cold the next day, flaked into a salad with the leftover onion and lemon.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "m_btn": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Shop Salmon Lovers Box",
            "button_link": "/products/salmon-lovers-box-12-servings",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_size": "md",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true
          }
        }
      },
